WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.237
&gt;&gt; THE EU FOREIGN
POLICY CHIEF SPEAKING VERY

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:07.039
BLUNT TERMS ABOUT WHAT THE
RESPONSE WOULD BE FROM NATO IN

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:11.077
THE UNITED STATES SHOULD THERE
BE A NUCLEAR WEAPON USED BY THE

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:14.848
RUSSIANS IN UKRAINE.
HERE HE IS, LISTEN TO THIS.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:21.087
&gt;&gt; ANY NUCLEAR TALK AGAINST
UKRAINE WILL CREATE AN ANSWER.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:27.660
NOT A NUCLEAR ANSWER, BUT SUCH
A POWERFUL ANSWER FROM THE

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:33.032
MILITARY SIDE THAT RUSSIAN ARMY
WOULD BE ANNIHILATED.

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:36.870
AND PUTIN SHOULD NOT BE
BLUFFING.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:40.006
&gt;&gt; HOW WOULD THOSE WORDS BE
HEARD BY THE KREMLIN?

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:43.676
&gt;&gt; THE KREMLIN HAS HEARD THIS
BEFORE AND MAYBE NOT AS

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:47.780
DIRECTLY BUT I THINK THAT HE IS
REALLY BEING QUITE OVER IN THIS.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.885
BUT THAT IS CERTAINLY PART OF
WHAT WE UNDERSTAND TO BE THE

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:55.088
POSSIBLE REACTION FROM THE
UNITED STATES, NATO ET CETERA.

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:59.158
TO ANY USE OF THE NUCLEAR
WEAPONS.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:06.399
ESPECIALLY THOSE WEAPONS WE'VE
TALKED ABOUT UKRAINE.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:13.573
THE WEST, ESPECIALLY NATO, DOES
NOT WANT TO REACT AND MAKE THE

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:17.644
SITUATION EVEN WORSE BUT
BEGINNING IN NUCLEAR WAR BUT

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:22.882
THEY COULD REALLY CARRY OUT
EXTREMELY DESTRUCTION OF THE

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:28.021
RUSSIAN FORCES IN THE FIELD.
PUTIN I'M SURE, BECAUSE WE'VE

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:32.992
HEARD THERE HAVE BEEN SIGNALS
AND NOT ONLY SIGNALS BUT DIRECT

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:37.063
WARNINGS TO WAR RUSSIA AND
PUTIN THAT THIS IS WHAT COULD

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:40.633
HAPPEN IF YOU DO THAT.
SO I AM SURE THAT IT IS NO

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.969
SURPRISE TO HIM.
IS IT GOING TO STOP HIM?

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:48.808
THAT IS THE QUESTION.
BUT, IT IS A VERY SERIOUS

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:53.079
THREAT.
&gt;&gt; WE ARE NOT THE DELICATE

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:55.215
POINT HERE.
THE CUBAN MISSILE CRISIS BACK

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:56.950
IN THE DAY.
SIMILAR PLACE RIGHT NOW.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.185
JILL, AS ALWAYS THANK YOU FOR
BEING WITH, US APPRECIATE IT.

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.654
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU JOHN.
CNN'S NICK PATON WALSH LIVE

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:06.025
IN CENTRAL UKRAINE FOR US.
WHAT DO WE KNOW ABOUT THESE

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.194
LATEST STRIKES?
THIS HAS BEEN FOUR OR FIVE

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:11.164
NIGHTS IN A ROW OF STRIKES
AGAINST IN MANY CASES CIVILIAN

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:16.436
LOCATIONS.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YEAH, LOOK, I THINK

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:19.405
IT'S FAIR TO SAY WE ARE SEEING A
SLIGHTLY DIFFERENT PATTERN, A

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:23.876
NEW PATTERN THIS WEEK SINCE THE
VAST WAVE OF STRIKES ON MONDAY.

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:27.714
THERE ARE PERSISTENT BIDS, IT
SEEMS TO HIT ENERGY OR OTHER

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:31.184
PARTS OF INFRASTRUCTURE.
LOCAL OFFICIALS SAYING VERY

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:32.652
LITTLE.
I THINK THERE IS A CONCERN TO

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:36.289
NOT PROVIDE A READOUT OF HOW
DAMAGING STRIKES HAVE BEEN

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:40.660
SIMPLY SAYING THAT ENERGY
INFRASTRUCTURE HAS BEEN HIT IN

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.195
ONE OF THE DISTRICTS OF
ZAPORIZHZHIA.

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:46.399
NO TALK OF INJURIES OR PRECISELY
WHAT KIND OF DAMAGE OCCURRED.

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:52.171
THIS DOES APPEAR TO BE SOMETHING
RUSSIA IS TRYING TO CONTINUALLY

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:53.906
SUSTAIN.
HOW MANY OF THESE GUIDED

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:57.443
MISSILES DO THEY HAVE.
I SHOULD ALSO POINT OUT TARGETS

00:02:57.443 --> 00:03:00.313
IS NOTHING NEW.
THE ONE THING THAT IS REMARKABLE

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:06.786
TODAY IS THAT VLADIMIR PUTIN HAS
BEEN IN KAZAKHSTAN FOR A MEETING

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:12.959
OF REGIONAL COUNTRIES.
HE'S MADE AN INTERESTING COMMENT

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:16.529
NOT ABOUT THE UKRAINIAN WAR BUT
SAYING THEY NEED GOODWILL.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:19.932
HE SAYS EVERYONE HAS GOODWILL
AND WE NEED TO USE THIS GOODWILL

00:03:19.932 --> 00:03:22.502
TO THE MAXIMUM IN RESOLVING
CONFLICTS.

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:26.072
WE MUST STRIVE TO FIND WAYS OUT
OF THE CURRENT SITUATION

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:29.375
WHEREVER IT ARISES.
IN THE PAST BECAUSE THE KREMLIN

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:33.146
SAYS ONE THING AND DO THE OTHER,
WE'VE NOW HEARD FOR A NUMBER OF

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:37.717
DAYS THIS PERSISTENT NOISE FROM
MOSCOW ABOUT DIPLOMACY, ABOUT

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:40.019
PERHAPS FINDING A WAY OUT OF
THIS.

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:43.756
GIVEN THE PRESSURE PUTIN IS
UNDER DOMESTICALLY TO MAKE A

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:47.260
PUBLIC STATEMENT SAYING GOODWILL
IS REQUIRED TO FIND A WAY OUT OF

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:50.863
THE SITUATION, THAT IS A CHANGE
IN TONE CERTAINLY IN THE PAST

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:54.701
DAYS WHILE THEY UNLEASHED THOSE
WAVES OF MISSILES, THE NUCLEAR

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:58.204
RHETORIC WE'VE HAD IN THE PAST,
THAT HAS LESSENED THE RESPONSE

00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:01.074
FROM THE WEST TO WHAT
POTENTIALLY MIGHT OCCUR IF

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:04.844
RUSSIA USED NUCLEAR WEAPONS.
THAT HAS BEEN VERY FORCEFUL AND

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:08.881
VERY PUBLIC.
YOU JUST HEARD THE E.U. FORMER

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:12.218
POLICY CHIEF THERE.
A CHANGE CERTAINLY.

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:15.254
YOU MAY HEAR MORE FROM PUTIN IN
KAZAKHSTAN.

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:18.958
HE'S MEETING WITH HIS TURKISH
COUNTERPART THERE.

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:25.398
THIS IS A NEW MOVE TOWARDS
DIPLOMACY.

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:31.604
IT'S ONE WHETHER THEY RESPECT.
THEY'VE ALWAYS USED IT IN THE

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:34.574
PAST MOST OF THE TIME AS A
STALLING MECHANISM, TIME TO

00:04:34.574 --> 00:04:37.276
REGROUP.
WINTER IS CERTAINLY COMING HERE.

00:04:37.276 --> 00:04:40.045
RUSSIA IS IN SEVERE TROUBLE ON
THE BATTLEFIELD.

00:04:40.045 --> 00:04:44.517
THEY'VE SAID THEY'RE GOING TO
EVACUATE CIVILIANS IN THE

00:04:44.517 --> 00:04:51.290
SOUTHERN CITY OF KHERSON.
SUPPLY CHAINS ARE DIFFICULT.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.526
A LOT CHANGING.
BACK TO YOU.

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:55.862
&gt;&gt; NICK PEYTON WALSH FOR US IN
CENTRAL UKRAINE.

